cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Parkinson Wearable Digital Biomarkers
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it using these metadata."
authors:
  - family-names: Mohamad
    given-names: "679"
    affiliation: "GitHub"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mohamad679/parkinson-wearable-digital-biomarkers"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-06-29
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: |
  A reproducible research baseline for detecting freezing-of-gait (FoG) events 
  from wearable accelerometer time-series. Implements subject-aware validation, 
  class-weighted models, discrimination metrics, and probability calibration 
  for candidate digital biomarkers in Parkinson's disease research.
keywords:
  - parkinson-disease
  - freezing-of-gait
  - wearable-sensors
  - accelerometer
  - digital-biomarkers
  - machine-learning
  - subject-aware-validation
  - reproducible-research
references:
  - type: dataset
    title: "Daphnet Freezing of Gait Dataset"
    authors:
